			"Message": "docs(Echo): Add Parameters/Returns doc sections to StealingQueue methods\n\nContinue the documentation standardization from commit 9276508 into the StealingQueue module. Add `## Returns` section to `Context::Next()` documenting its `Option<TTask>` return type, and add both `## Parameters` and `## Returns` sections to `Context::Steal()` clarifying its injector, stealer, and local deque arguments alongside the return semantics.\n\nThese additions complete the doc-coverage pass across all public methods in the Queue module. No functional changes.",
